    "detailed_description": "<strong>A Magical Action RPG + Strategy, Building &amp; Raiding &amp; Battling Adventure!</strong> <br>Discover your powers and defend the homeland in Elder\u2019s Grace, Unchained.<br><br><strong>BUILD</strong> - Craft traps, minions &amp; defense materials to unleash foreboding stronghold designs, safeguarding the riches within.  Thwart invaders and the bounty is yours.<br><br><strong>RAID</strong> - Prepare specialized teams through quests, clashes &amp; even breeding.  Fight through live action battles, find the treasure &amp; it\u2019s yours to keep. <br><br><strong>BATTLE</strong> - Play Last Mobley Standing, an epic PvPvE mode where there can only be one winner!  It\u2019s a battle to the end where everyone is Playing for Keeps!  <br><br>In a selfless act to save their homeland from monstrous invaders, the Elder Mobley harnessed the magic of the land, yielding fantastical powers but costing the ultimate price - their lives. Through their sacrifice, a new generation of Mobley is born, now with powers unchained.<br><br>It\u2019s your turn to find the magic within and defend the homeland once more. Protect your treasure and embark on epic battling adventures in Elder\u2019s Grace, Unchained.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594600/extras/472b3129c26d8c79a1cef668a30efb06.poster.avif?t=1742830597\" width=600 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594600/extras/472b3129c26d8c79a1cef668a30efb06.webm?t=1742830597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594600/extras/472b3129c26d8c79a1cef668a30efb06.mp4?t=1742830597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>A Magical Action RPG + Strategy, Building &amp; Raiding &amp; Battling Adventure!</strong> <br>Discover your powers and defend the homeland in Elder\u2019s Grace, Unchained.<br><br><strong>BUILD</strong> - Craft traps, minions &amp; defense materials to unleash foreboding stronghold designs, safeguarding the riches within.  Thwart invaders and the bounty is yours.<br><br><strong>RAID</strong> - Prepare specialized teams through quests, clashes &amp; even breeding.  Fight through live action battles, find the treasure &amp; it\u2019s yours to keep. <br><br><strong>BATTLE</strong> - Play Last Mobley Standing, an epic PvPvE mode where there can only be one winner!  It\u2019s a battle to the end where everyone is Playing for Keeps!  <br><br>In a selfless act to save their homeland from monstrous invaders, the Elder Mobley harnessed the magic of the land, yielding fantastical powers but costing the ultimate price - their lives. Through their sacrifice, a new generation of Mobley is born, now with powers unchained.<br><br>It\u2019s your turn to find the magic within and defend the homeland once more. Protect your treasure and embark on epic battling adventures in Elder\u2019s Grace, Unchained.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594600/extras/472b3129c26d8c79a1cef668a30efb06.poster.avif?t=1742830597\" width=600 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594600/extras/472b3129c26d8c79a1cef668a30efb06.webm?t=1742830597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594600/extras/472b3129c26d8c79a1cef668a30efb06.mp4?t=1742830597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
